---
kind: lore
id: east.people
title: Eastmarch leaders and crew
---

// The leaders' and the Meridian crew's lines outside their battles.
// Volta and Fern are the lead's cast; what they say in Eastmarch is east's.

// ── the Meridian ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastMeridianDeck" on="enterPlace" target="place.ferryMeridian" category="ambient" priority="5" once="day">
  @narrator: The Meridian's deck. The piano below is still being played badly, which is somehow a comfort.
</entry>

<entry id="eastPellBark" on="talk" target="npc.meridianSteward" category="bark">
  @meridianSteward: The ballroom closes at midnight. The crew's quarters never close. The captain's cabin is closed until the captain stops being ill.
</entry>

<entry id="eastPellPassengers" on="talk" target="npc.meridianSteward" category="bark" priority="10" when="quest.eastMeridianPassengers.state == 'active'">
  @meridianSteward: If I may: several of our passengers have been hoping for a battle with a guest of Mr. Cassius. It would make their voyage. And, frankly, mine.
</entry>

<entry id="eastOrlaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.captainOrla" category="bark" when="holds('hasItem', ['hmCut'])">
  @captainOrla: Back on my feet, thanks to you. The sea and I have agreed to a truce. It'll break it first. It always does.
</entry>

<entry id="eastOrlaSpark" on="talk" target="npc.captainOrla" category="bark" priority="10" when="holds('hasItem', ['hmCut']) && holds('hasBadge', ['spark'])">
  @captainOrla{emotion="happy"}: You cut the council's tree AND beat Volta? I've been telling the council to cut that tree since I was a cabin boy.
</entry>

// ── Lt. Volta ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastVoltaBefore" on="talk" target="npc.volta" category="bark" when="!holds('defeated', ['volta'])">
  @volta: You want to battle me, kid, you come to the gym. Through the front door. Past my crew. Like a soldier.
</entry>

<entry id="eastVoltaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.volta" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['volta'])">
  @volta{emotion="smug"}: Kid! You're still in Portvolt? Go and see the old plant down Route 8 some night. The lights come on by themselves. Electric monsters love it. So do I.
</entry>

// ── Fern ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="eastFernBefore" on="talk" target="npc.fern" category="bark" when="!holds('defeated', ['fern'])">
  @fern: Oh. Hello. Are you here for a battle? The gym is just there. I'll be along. In a minute. After a little rest.
</entry>

<entry id="eastFernAfter" on="talk" target="npc.fern" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['fern'])">
  @fern{emotion="happy"}: With Fly you can go anywhere you've been. I usually go home. It's where the bed is.
</entry>
